                \frac{2}{n^2}\left\| K_{\tilde{\ell}+1, \ell_{\gamma}} 
                Z (Z^{\top} 
                Z)^{-1}\Sigma_{\leq \tilde{\ell}}^{-1} \theta_{\leq \tilde{\ell}} \right\|_{2}^{2}
                + O_{d, \mathbb{P}}\left( d^{(2-\min\{s, 2\})\tilde{\ell}-2\gamma }\right)\\

