    \left\| \tilde{f}_{\lambda} - f_{\lambda}\right\|_{L^{2}}$ and $\mathrm{bias}(\hat{f}_{\lambda}) \geq \left\| f_{\lambda} - f_{\star}\right\|_{L^{2}} 
    -
