    \begin{itemize}
        \item From Lemma D.6 and Lemma D.14 in \cite{lu2024saturation}, we have 
        $$
        \left\| f_{\lambda} - f_{\star}\right\|_{L^{2}}^2 = \mathcal{M}_{2, \varphi}(\lambda) = \Theta_d\left( 
