        $$
    On the other hand, following the proof of Lemma D.7 in \cite{lu2024saturation}, with (63) and (64) of \cite{lu2024saturation} being 

    restated as
    (\ref{eqn:check_condition_bias_1}),
 we have 
 \begin{equation*}
        \left\| \tilde{f}_{\lambda} - f_{\lambda}\right\|_{L^{2}}^2 = o_{d, \mathbb{P}}\left( \mathcal{M}_{2, \varphi}(\lambda) + \frac{\sigma^2}{n} \mathcal{N}_{2,\varphi}(\lambda)  \right).
