          = &~
    n \cdot \Theta_{d} \left( \frac{n}{d^{\ell_{\lambda}+1}(n\lambda+1)^{2}} + \frac{d^{\ell_{\lambda}}}{n} + 
    d^{-(\ell_{\lambda}+1)s}
    +\mathbf{1}\{\tau<\infty\}\lambda^{2\tau}d^{(2\tau-\tilde{s})\ell_{\lambda} }\right)\\
    = &~ \Omega_d (A_1 + A_2 + A_3).
