    \item We have
    $$
        \mathbf{I}=d^{-2u(s-1) -\gamma +\ell_{\lambda}s} = d^{\ell_{\lambda}} d^{-u(s-1) -\gamma}d^{(\ell_{\lambda}-u)(s-1)} = o_d( d^{\ell_{\lambda}})=o_d(A_2).
