    When $s<2$, we have
    $$
    \mathbf{III} = d^{-u + \ell_{\lambda}(2-s)} (\ln(d))^3 = d^{\ell_{\lambda}} d^{-u - \ell_{\lambda}(s-1)} (\ln(d))^3 = o_d( d^{\ell_{\lambda}})=o_d(A_2).
